  "content": "<h4>FTBLib 是一个库模组，用于支持我们所有的模组。它允许在游戏中编辑一些配置，支持同一包内的多种模式等。</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;FTB 模组家族：</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-utilities\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Utilities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-guides\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Guides</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-quests\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Quests</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-achievements\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB&nbsp;Achievements</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-banners\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Banners</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/team-islands\" rel=\"nofollow\">Team Islands</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Tweaks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-money\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Money</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftbtrophies\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Trophies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftblib/relations/dependents?filter-related-dependents=3\" rel=\"nofollow\">其他</a></li>\n</ul>",
